# Line endings are normalised to LF everywhere, including Windows checkouts.
#
# This is not a style preference. Canonicalization, event ids, and signatures
# are defined over exact bytes, and CI checks that regenerating examples/ is
# byte-identical. A CRLF conversion on checkout would break that check on any
# platform that disagrees with the one that generated the files.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Signed material and conformance vectors: never touch these bytes.
examples/*.json -text
tests/vectors/** -text
